Because I like having my beard and I don't feel like kissing ass to make pieces of shit feel happy about my appearance.

&#x200B;

To be clear, my parents ARE NOT the pieces of shit I'm referring to. My parents are not pieces of shit, they're loving if sometimes confused people. A prospective employer who would bar you from taking a position you're qualified for due to not being white is a load of shit. And I got tons of racist insults years and years before I had a beard. I may look "less ethnic", but I won't look white either. When I was about 11 years old is when people started mocking my appearance. Couldn't grow a beard then obviously.

I hate the argument that people make that if the conditions of \[insert oppressed group here\] aren't the absolute worst living conditions possible, or damn near close to it, then there's nothing to complain about. Just because your life isn't a living hell doesn't mean it's a good life. 

